              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buleeyi khubotookhelela lukoba bulaba chimita chielefu tisa. Lisina lie lukoba khukhwamila siise esio khukhwola libe: “Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ali ebweeneyo.”",
          "type": "text",
